# This repository publishes the browsable archive and nothing else.
#
# The scrape and build pipeline, its scratch trees, its reviewed configuration
# and the preservation evidence it produces all stay on disk and out of version
# control. None of it is needed to browse the site, and none of it is fetched
# by any published page.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.vercelignore
!/vercel.json
!/public/

# Audit artifacts that live in the output directory because the checkers read
# them from there. No published page or client script references any of them.
/public/manifest.json
/public/link-classifications.json
/public/archive-expansion-ledger.json
/public/archive-cdx-inventory.json
/public/archive-query-cdx-inventory.json
/public/archive-query-manifest.json
/public/archive-failures.json
/public/external-capture-manifest.json
/public/archive-redactions.json
/public/assets/vendor-failures.json
/public/assets/static-dependency-failures.json

# Repository housekeeping that ended up inside the output directory.
/public/AGENTS.md
/public/.gitignore

.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
